OL,3,AShip sinks in new drone attack off
OL,4,ABulgaria, PM summons Russian ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FA merchant ship has sunk after drones
OL,7,Fhit two vessels off Bulgaria's Black
OL,8,FSea coast, Prime Minister Rumen Radev
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FHe indicated Russia was suspected of
OL,12,Fthe attacks and that he had called in
OL,13,Fits ambassador.
OL,15,FOne of the ships went down 17 nautical
OL,16,Fmiles (31km) east of Krapets and one
OL,17,Fcrew member was saved, he said. The
OL,18,Fother, Ukrainian-owned vessel was hit
OL,19,Fby three drones 18 nautical miles from
OL,20,Fthe town of Byala and all 15 crew were
OL,21,Frescued, he added.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
