OL,3,AShip sinks in new drone attack off
OL,4,ABulgaria, PM summons Russian ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe drone attacks come a week after two
OL,7,Fother commercial ships were hit by sea
OL,8,Fand aerial drones in Bulgaria's
OL,9,Fexclusive economic zone. One of the
OL,10,Fships, the Alfa Watan, sank and all 10
OL,11,Fcrew, including nine Syrians, are
OL,12,Fpresumed dead.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
